<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Upcoming Hackathon Events in Jaipur and India September 2026 | Jaipur Engineers</title><meta name="description" content="Upcoming hackathon events in Jaipur and India in September 2026, including Jaipur, AI, Web3, hardware and student innovation events."><meta name="keywords" content="hackathon events Jaipur, hackathon September 2026, Jaipur hackathon, AI hackathon India, student hackathon"><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.jaipurengineers.com/news/jaipur-hackathon-events-september-2026.php"></head><body><main><article><p><a href="/news/">Technology News</a> · Hackathon Events · September 14, 2026</p><h1>Upcoming Hackathon Events in Jaipur and India: September 2026</h1><p>Hackathon activity is strong across India this September, with events covering AI, Web3, hardware, software development and open innovation.</p><h2>HackIndia Spark-12 Jaipur</h2><p>HackIndia Spark-12 is scheduled for September 18–19, 2026 at Poornima Institute of Engineering & Technology (PIET), Jaipur. The event is a 36-hour innovation sprint covering AI/ML, Web3, blockchain, hardware and IoT, cloud computing and open innovation. The event page currently states that registration has closed.</p><h2>AMIHACKS 2026 — Jaipur</h2><p>AMIHACKS 2026 is scheduled for September 24–25, 2026 at Amity University Rajasthan, Jaipur. The 24-hour hackathon lists a ₹70K+ prize pool and tracks covering industry and enterprise automation and NGO/social welfare solutions.</p><h2>TechSurge 2K26 — Telangana</h2><p>TechSurge 2K26 is scheduled for September 18–19, 2026 at BVRIT Narsapur. Its flagship Kalachakra hackathon is planned as a 28-hour build sprint for undergraduate teams, with AI and prompt-engineering activities alongside workshops and mentorship.</p><h2>Why Students Should Watch These Events</h2><p>Hackathons are useful for building practical experience with coding, AI, APIs, databases, cloud services, UI/UX and teamwork. Before registering, participants should verify eligibility, registration status, team size, fees and the official schedule on the event organizer's website.</p><h2>Event Sources</h2><ul><li><a href="https://hackindia.org/2026/hackindia-spark-12-jaipur-rajasthan-north-india-region" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">HackIndia Spark-12 Jaipur</a></li><li><a href="https://amihacks2026.vercel.app/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">AMIHACKS 2026</a></li><li><a href="https://hackindia.org/2026/techsurge-2k26" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">TechSurge 2K26</a></li></ul><p><a href="/news/">← Back to latest technology news</a></p></article></main></body></html>
